%%MODELNAME Basic
%%DECKNAME Dev
%%TAGS nvim
%Front
Resilience - an external call (e.g. bot.init to a network API) can hang forever with no log. How do you make the failure diagnosable?
%Front
%Back
Race it against a timeout (withTimeout(promise, ms, label) using Promise.race) so it rejects with a logged error and exits non-zero (container restarts) instead of becoming a silent zombie. Mitigates the symptom; does not fix the underlying reachability.
%Back
